      "lines":[
        {
          "n":"0",
          "text":"Uh, I used to rock a double XL",
          "rhyme":"El",
          "persona_id":"Mac_Miller"
        },
        {
          "n":"1",
          "text":"Now the ladies all say I dress well",
          "rhyme":"El",
          "persona_id":"Mac_Miller"
        },
        {
          "n":"2",
          "text":"With a nice pair of jeans, LRG or Evisu",
          "rhyme":"y",
          "persona_id":"Mac_Miller"
        },
        {
          "n":"3",
          "text":"Crew neck sweatshirt, hat and some clean shoes",
          "rhyme":"is",
          "persona_id":"Mac_Miller"
        },
        {
          "n":"4",
          "text":"Pockets stayed equipped with some paper and some gold piff",
          "rhyme":"if",
          "persona_id":"Mac_Miller"
        },
        {
          "n":"5",
          "text":"Pack of gum, squares, Blackberry and a phone clip (Goddamn)",
          "rhyme":"ip",
          "persona_id":"Mac_Miller"
        },
        {
          "n":"6",
          "text":"Got Most dope clique, bunch of mothafuckers lookin' fresh",
          "rhyme":"aS",
          "persona_id":"Mac_Miller"
        },
        {
          "n":"7",
          "text":"Crooks and castle dress, sloppy sloppy haters shouldn't mess",
          "rhyme":"Es",
          "persona_id":"Mac_Miller"
        },
        {
          "n":"8",
          "text":"Walkin' by your lady and I'm sorry if I took her breath",
          "rhyme":"at",
          "persona_id":"Mac_Miller"
        },
        {
          "n":"9",
          "text":"You was just baby, cryin' 'til you end up shook to death (Bitch)",
          "rhyme":"at",
          "persona_id":"Mac_Miller"
        },
        {
          "n":"10",
          "text":"Fade away like an Etch A Sketch",
          "rhyme":"EtS",
          "persona_id":"Mac_Miller"
        },
        {
          "n":"11",
          "text":"Don't second guess, ain't nobody better dressed (Uh-uh)",
          "rhyme":"e",
          "persona_id":"Mac_Miller"
        },
        {
          "n":"12",
          "text":"Text hoes wearin' less clothes than her mama like",
          "rhyme":"Ejk",
          "persona_id":"Mac_Miller"
        },
        {
          "n":"13",
          "text":"Church girl, always go to school, she the honest type (Haha)",
          "rhyme":"ip",
          "persona_id":"Mac_Miller"
        },
        {
          "n":"14",
          "text":"But when it comes to boys, she like 'em bad",
          "rhyme":"ad",
          "persona_id":"Mac_Miller"
        },
        {
          "n":"15",
          "text":"So holla at the kid, I got swag",
          "rhyme":"ag",
          "persona_id":"Mac_Miller"
        }
      ],
