      "performer":"",
      "lines":[
        {
          "n":"0",
          "text":"Knick-knack, paddy-whack, give that boy some clothes",
          "rhyme":"at",
          "persona_id":"Mac_Miller"
        },
        {
          "n":"1",
          "text":"Imitate the kid, you may get yourself some hoes (Haha)",
          "rhyme":"is",
          "persona_id":"Mac_Miller"
        },
        {
          "n":"2",
          "text":"Snap back, flat cap, abstract swagger (Uh-huh)",
          "rhyme":"e",
          "persona_id":"Mac_Miller"
        },
        {
          "n":"3",
          "text":"Kid come correct, never messin' up the pattern",
          "rhyme":"ERn",
          "persona_id":"Mac_Miller"
        },
        {
          "n":"4",
          "text":"Y'all jigsaw puzzle, mismatch mess (Mess)",
          "rhyme":"Es",
          "persona_id":"Mac_Miller"
        },
        {
          "n":"5",
          "text":"Got my J's on with some jeans, lookin' fresh",
          "rhyme":"aS",
          "persona_id":"Mac_Miller"
        },
        {
          "n":"6",
          "text":"Yes, my colors match",
          "rhyme":"atS",
          "persona_id":"Mac_Miller"
        },
        {
          "n":"7",
          "text":"And ain't no other cats lookin' like the kid",
          "rhyme":"id",
          "persona_id":"Mac_Miller"
        },
        {
          "n":"8",
          "text":"Yeah, none of y'all fuck with Mac (Ha)",
          "rhyme":"ak",
          "persona_id":"Mac_Miller"
        },
        {
          "n":"9",
          "text":"You rockin' somethin' that lookin' like a lumberjack",
          "rhyme":"ak",
          "persona_id":"Mac_Miller"
        },
        {
          "n":"10",
          "text":"How you wearin' three different t-shirts under that?",
          "rhyme":"a",
          "persona_id":"Mac_Miller"
        },
        {
          "n":"11",
          "text":"Teach you how to dress real stylish, I'm the wildest",
          "rhyme":"Est",
          "persona_id":"Mac_Miller"
        },
        {
          "n":"12",
          "text":"Nothin' on me lookin' childish (Haha)",
          "rhyme":"iS",
          "persona_id":"Mac_Miller"
        },
        {
          "n":"13",
          "text":"Fire talk, I am hot",
          "rhyme":"Ot",
          "persona_id":"Mac_Miller"
        },
        {
          "n":"14",
          "text":"And y'all is just some mild sauce",
          "rhyme":"os",
          "persona_id":"Mac_Miller"
        },
        {
          "n":"15",
          "text":"Got my clothes tailored, fit so nicely",
          "rhyme":"i",
          "persona_id":"Mac_Miller"
        },
        {
          "n":"16",
          "text":"Soon you'll see these mothafuckers dressin' just like me",
          "rhyme":"@",
